The Singers of the Herald's Star are a group in [[Org/Belvedere/index|Belvedere]], in [[Geography/Austrene/index|Austrene]], and have been around a year or two. They call for the city's nobility to be broken up and its hierarchy flattened. They are not friendly with the nobles they mean to unseat, and they keep out of reach of them.

[[People/Galzu|Galzu]], [[People/Anzu|Anzu]]'s sister, spent four or five months talking with them before she vanished. The night she disappeared, a Belvedere archival facility was broken into and a Voidsong-touched object was carried off. The group's name hides its meaning: the singers are the [[Phenomena/Harmony/Voidsong|Voidsong]], and the Herald is the evil god of the [[Divinity/Ashen Pact/index|Ashen Pact]].
